{"identity_key": "bilibili:1152582026107289640", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1152582026107289640", "content": "声优楠木灯宣布结婚\n新年快乐。\n谨向平日关照我的各位报告一件事。\n虽是私事，但我决定与学生时代开始交往的对象结婚。\n对方并非从事演艺相关工作，恳请大家今后避免进行猜测性的发言或报道。\n我将一如既往地认真对待工作，并力求更进一步成长。今后也绝不会忘记对各位的感激之情，必将诚心诚意、全力以赴。恳请各位继续给予指导和鞭策！\n\n2026年1月1日\n楠木灯", "publisher": "KIDFansClub", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1152582026107289640", "published_at": "2025-12-31T15:26:55+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/412c91fb7b44d9173cad03d4be4cb33b2805329.png"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_2805329", "uid": "2805329", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "声优楠木灯宣布结婚", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 118, "retweets": 4, "replies": 8}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
{"identity_key": "bilibili:1152584366864465968", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1152584366864465968", "content": "声优日笠阳子宣布离婚\n致一直支持我的各位：\n一直以来非常感谢大家的支持。\n此次因个人私事深感惶恐，特此告知我已解除婚姻关系。\n经过对未来的深思熟虑，我们决定各自前行。\n对于至今所拥有的一切缘分，以及塑造了如今的我所有的相遇与日常，我深怀感激。\n今后我也将继续努力精进，若能继续得到大家温暖的守护，我将深感荣幸。\n\n2025年12月31日\n日笠阳子", "publisher": "KIDFansClub", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1152584366864465968", "published_at": "2025-12-31T15:36:00+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/19572c3982451bd500c35e6cbcad19d42805329.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_2805329", "uid": "2805329", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "声优日笠阳子宣布离婚", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 70, "retweets": 1, "replies": 4}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
